{"availability":"available","full":"SamG-Coder/RealGrass","name":"RealGrass","description":"An infinite GPU meadow with simulated grass, wildflowers and evolving volumetric clouds. CUDA C to WebGPU.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-21T08:28:38Z","updated":"2026-09-21T08:28:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://samg-coder.github.io/RealGrass/","topics":["gpu-computing","grass","procedural-generation","webgpu"],"demo":"https://samg-coder.github.io/RealGrass/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:52.128Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:52.128Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:52.128Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:03:52.128Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2102141213658972301","postId":"2102141213658972301","postedAt":"2026-09-21T21:01:35.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:52.128Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An endless meadow grown, simulated and rendered on the GPU.","RealGrass combines seeded grass colonies, wildflowers, spring-based wind motion and evolving volumetric clouds on an uninterrupted flat plane. Clouds shade the meadow and influence its gusts. There is no mountain backdrop or distance haze.","Built on cuda-webshader: CUDA C kernels compile to WGSL in the browser, and a custom WebGPU renderer reads the resulting storage buffers directly. No native CUDA installation is needed."],"features":["Seeded crowns, tillers, ordered leaves, flowering stems and mixed growth habits.","Persistent GPU wind simulation and interactive brush bending.","Streaming grass around the camera, distance-based geometry and distant flowers.","Procedural grass/soil albedo and normal maps.","Evolving 3D clouds, sunlight occlusion and moving cloud shadows."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SamG-Coder/RealGrass/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a0b62112520ea1